{'symbol': 'KDP', 'date': '2019-11-06 22:30:00', 'title': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. REPORTS EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019', 'text': 'KEURIG DR PEPPER INC. ANNOUNCED EARNINGS RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER ENDED SEPTEMBER 30, 2019. FOR THE THIRD QUARTER, THE COMPANY ANNOUNCED SALES WAS USD 2,870 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 2,732 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 580 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 345 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 304 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 149 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.22 COMPARED TO USD 0.11 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.21 COMPARED TO USD 0.11 A YEAR AGO. FOR THE NINE MONTHS, SALES WAS USD 8,186 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 4,629 MILLION A YEAR AGO. OPERATING INCOME WAS USD 1,665 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 690 MILLION A YEAR AGO. NET INCOME WAS USD 848 MILLION COMPARED TO USD 320 MILLION A YEAR AGO. BASIC EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.6 COMPARED TO USD 0.33 A YEAR AGO. DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WAS USD 0.6 COMPARED TO USD 0.32 A YEAR AGO.'}